Subject: [PATCH 11/27] config: site groups (beta), an Auto of its own for each
 service

With site-groups on, Instagram, WhatsApp, Telegram, ChatGPT and YouTube each get a
URL test group over the same servers as Auto, testing the service's own page, and
a route rule before the first VPN rule (direct rules still win).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
